{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x18---a-star-is-burns",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x18 - A Star is Burns",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x18 - A Star is Burns.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:07.856Z",
  "lineCount": 278,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "A Star Is Burns",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 2840,
      "endMs": 4283
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Hello, I'm Kent Brockman, and this is Eye on Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 24283,
      "endMs": 28545
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Tonight, Springfield's answer to the Benedictine monks: The rapping rabbis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 63780,
      "endMs": 68579
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Don 't eat pork Not even with a fork Can 't touch this Marge, are we Jewish?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 68780,
      "endMs": 74921
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "No, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 75122,
      "endMs": 77136
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "But first, we all stink. We all... Hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 79954,
      "endMs": 82538
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "According to a survey ranking Springfield as the least popular city in America.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 82706,
      "endMs": 87572
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "In science, dead last.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 87740,
      "endMs": 89417
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "I'm telling you people, the Earth revolves around the sun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 89585,
      "endMs": 93847
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Burn him!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 94015,
      "endMs": 95424
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "What a story. You've stolen my soul!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 96766,
      "endMs": 100089
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "In culture, dead last.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100290,
      "endMs": 102068
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Eleanor, we've got to do something about this depression. So I propose...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 102270,
      "endMs": 107102
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Oh, that's right. I'm crippled.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 107270,
      "endMs": 110089
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "This is terrible. People will start to avoid Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110290,
      "endMs": 113277
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "But what can I do? I'm just...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113478,
      "endMs": 115793
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "...one man. - I think we should call a town meeting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 115961,
      "endMs": 118780
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "If we don't do something soon, we won't get any tourists.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 118948,
      "endMs": 121565
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Are there any suggestions for how to attract more tourism?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122981,
      "endMs": 125766
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "The easiest way to be popular is to leech off the popularity of others.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 127276,
      "endMs": 131571
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "So we propose changing our name from Springfield to Seinfeld.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 131739,
      "endMs": 136907
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "I'm Marge Simpson, and I have an idea.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 139341,
      "endMs": 142160
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Oh, no.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 142328,
      "endMs": 143469
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Marge is gonna say something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144106,
      "endMs": 145448
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Now, I know you haven't liked some of my past suggestions.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 145650,
      "endMs": 148301
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Like switching to the metric system.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 148469,
      "endMs": 150281
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "The metric system is the tool of the devil!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 150415,
      "endMs": 154274
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "My car gets 40 rods to the hogshead, and that's the way I likes it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 154509,
      "endMs": 160247
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "The old person's remarks will be stricken.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 160448,
      "endMs": 162462
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Who said that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 162630,
      "endMs": 163905
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "But my new idea is different.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 164106,
      "endMs": 165482
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "I think we should hold a film festival and give out prizes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 165650,
      "endMs": 169744
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Could we make movies and enter them?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 169945,
      "endMs": 171757
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Yes. At last, an excuse to wear makeup.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 171958,
      "endMs": 175213
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "All in favor of Marge Simpson's film-festival idea?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 175448,
      "endMs": 178200
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Film festival! Film festival!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 178401,
      "endMs": 180885
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "You like my idea? Actually, I have several others.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 181120,
      "endMs": 184341
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Don 't push your luck! Don 't push your luck!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184542,
      "endMs": 187697
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "And action.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 189576,
      "endMs": 190918
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Hello, I'm Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 191153,
      "endMs": 192663
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "In the past, I've brought you such classic films as Homer in the Shower...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192831,
      "endMs": 196254
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "...and Homer on the Toilet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196422,
      "endMs": 197730
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "And now I give you The Eternal Struggle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 197898,
      "endMs": 201925
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Relaxed fit, my Aunt Fanny. Stupid Dockers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 202730,
      "endMs": 206589
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Oh, the belt is buckled.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 206757,
      "endMs": 210348
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Now, Maude, in our movie, you lay baby Moses in the basket...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 213972,
      "endMs": 216019
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "...then put it among the reeds, okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 216187,
      "endMs": 217932
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Lights, camera...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 218133,
      "endMs": 219643
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "...act-diddily-dotilly-doodilly action Jackson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 219811,
      "endMs": 222697
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Help me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 226254,
      "endMs": 229777
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Flanders to God Flanders to God Get off your cloud and save my Todd",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 233536,
      "endMs": 238401
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Thanks, God. Okely-dokely.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 245750,
      "endMs": 248267
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "What you doing, Ma?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 248469,
      "endMs": 249777
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Looking for a film critic to judge our festival.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 249945,
      "endMs": 252227
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Did you know there are over 600 critics on TV...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 252428,
      "endMs": 254878
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "...and Leonard Maltin is the best-looking of them all?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255046,
      "endMs": 258267
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Welcome to Coming Attractions. I'm your host, Jay Sherman. Thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258469,
      "endMs": 262965
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Tonight we review an aging Charles Bronson in Death Wish IX.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 263167,
      "endMs": 267764
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "I wish I was dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 267932,
      "endMs": 270683
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "But first we have a special guest, Rainier Wolfcastle...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 270885,
      "endMs": 273435
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "...star of the reprehensible McBain movies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273603,
      "endMs": 277428
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Jay, my new film is a mix of action und comedy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 277630,
      "endMs": 280683
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "It's called McBain: Let's Get Silly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 280851,
      "endMs": 284307
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Did you ever notice how men always leave the toilet seat up?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 284509,
      "endMs": 288905
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "That's the joke. You suck, McBain!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 289073,
      "endMs": 293267
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Now my Woody Allen impression.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 295381,
      "endMs": 297630
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "I'm a neurotic nerd who likes to sleep with little girls.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 297797,
      "endMs": 301388
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Hey, that really sucked!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 301556,
      "endMs": 303838
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "The film is just me in front of a brick wall for an hour and a half.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 307993,
      "endMs": 311517
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "It cost $80 million.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 311685,
      "endMs": 314134
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "How do you sleep at night?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 314302,
      "endMs": 316114
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "On top of a pile of money with many beautiful ladies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 316282,
      "endMs": 319973
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Just asking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 320141,
      "endMs": 322289
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "I like him. He's smart, he's sensitive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 322490,
      "endMs": 324940
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "He's not obsessed with his physical appearance.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325107,
      "endMs": 327423
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "My ears are burning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 327591,
      "endMs": 329168
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "I wasn't talking about you, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329369,
      "endMs": 331651
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "No, my ears are really burning. I wanted to see inside, so I lit a Q-Tip.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 331886,
      "endMs": 335376
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Dear Mr. Sherman, on behalf of the people of Springfield...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336852,
      "endMs": 339604
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "...I would like to invite you to judge our film festival.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 339772,
      "endMs": 343027
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "You can stay with us and enjoy the sights and sounds of the country.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 343195,
      "endMs": 346685
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Marge, is this a pimple or a boil? Just a minute, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 346852,
      "endMs": 350242
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Look what you made me write.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350409,
      "endMs": 351685
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Anyway, we think you'll really enjoy our quiet little town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 351852,
      "endMs": 354772
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Sincerely, Marge Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 354940,
      "endMs": 357322
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Do I really wanna leave Manhattan?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 357490,
      "endMs": 360242
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Sherman, I just realized you insulted me. Now you will die.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 360477,
      "endMs": 364940
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Hey, nudnik, your shoe's untied.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 365577,
      "endMs": 367792
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "From here, they appear to be tied. But I will go in for a closer look.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367993,
      "endMs": 372020
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Taxi. To the airport!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 372960,
      "endMs": 376685
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "On closer inspection, these are Loafers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 378832,
      "endMs": 383161
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Attention, the flight from New York has arrived.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386522,
      "endMs": 388972
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Hey, I'm landing here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 389140,
      "endMs": 390650
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "It's supposed to say Jay's name, not yours.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 394375,
      "endMs": 396858
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Oh, you're right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 397026,
      "endMs": 399643
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "There you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 401623,
      "endMs": 403234
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Just a second. Oh, that should...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 403401,
      "endMs": 407260
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Hello, I'm Marge Simpson, and this is my husband, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 407428,
      "endMs": 410549
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Oh, nice to meet you, Marge. I saw your hair from the plane.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 410717,
      "endMs": 413536
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "And you must be the man who didn't know if he had a pimple or a boil.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 413703,
      "endMs": 418133
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "It was a gummy bear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 418301,
      "endMs": 419643
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Coming up next, The Flintstones Meet the Jetsons.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 421583,
      "endMs": 425073
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "I smell another cheap cartoon crossover.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 425240,
      "endMs": 427589
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Bart Simpson, meet Jay Sherman the critic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 427757,
      "endMs": 430643
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Hello. Hey, man, I really love your show.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 430811,
      "endMs": 433026
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "I think all kids should watch it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 433193,
      "endMs": 434905
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "I suddenly feel so dirty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 435811,
      "endMs": 437656
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "I don't know what's happening. It seems our profits have dropped 37 percent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 443558,
      "endMs": 447585
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "We have a bad image, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 447787,
      "endMs": 449095
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Research shows people see you as something of an ogre.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 449263,
      "endMs": 451847
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "I ought to club them and eat their bones.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 452082,
      "endMs": 454431
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Maybe this film festival could help us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 455400,
      "endMs": 457212
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "A film biography might let them get to know the real you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 457380,
      "endMs": 460132
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Virtuous, heroic, nubile.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 460333,
      "endMs": 462682
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "You left out \"pleasant.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 462850,
      "endMs": 464930
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "But I like that film-biography idea.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 465098,
      "endMs": 467279
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "A slick Hollywood picture to gloss over my evil rise to power...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 467447,
      "endMs": 471608
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "...like Bugsy or Working Girl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471742,
      "endMs": 473454
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Get me Steven Spielberg.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 473622,
      "endMs": 475199
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "He's unavailable. Get his nonunion Mexican equivalent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 475434,
      "endMs": 479226
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Listen, Se�or Spielbergo...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 479460,
      "endMs": 480870
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "...I want you to do for me what Spielberg did for Oskar Schindler.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 481004,
      "endMs": 484226
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Listen, Spielbergo, Schindler and I are like peas in a pod.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 488700,
      "endMs": 491921
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "We're both factory owners. We both made shells for the Nazis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 492089,
      "endMs": 495042
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "But mine worked, damn it. Now, go out there and win me that festival!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 495210,
      "endMs": 499170
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Homer, the guest should get the last pork chop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503162,
      "endMs": 505679
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "But I'm still hungry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 505886,
      "endMs": 507783
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Mr. Sherman, I understand you have two Pulitzer Prizes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 518679,
      "endMs": 522162
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Well, it's not like I carry them around with me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 522369,
      "endMs": 525714
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "It's so hot in here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 525886,
      "endMs": 528093
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Oh, look, here's my People's Choice Award. Five Golden Globes...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 528266,
      "endMs": 533714
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Where's my Emmy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535714,
      "endMs": 537162
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Thank you. Yeah, well, I won...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538955,
      "endMs": 541507
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "...the belching contest at work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 541679,
      "endMs": 544783
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Very nice, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 547300,
      "endMs": 549231
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Wow, how many Pulitzer Prize winners can do that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 557748,
      "endMs": 560955
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Just me and Eudora Welty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561128,
      "endMs": 563093
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "I invited my sisters over.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 563714,
      "endMs": 566024
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Sisters. Allow me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 566197,
      "endMs": 569231
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "So then I said to Woody Allen, \"Well, Camus can do, but Sartre is 'smartre.'\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 573059,
      "endMs": 579679
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "So original.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 579921,
      "endMs": 581438
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "How droll.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 581610,
      "endMs": 582921
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Yeah, well, Scooby-Doo can doo-doo...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 583093,
      "endMs": 586576
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "...but Jimmy Carter is smarter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 586748,
      "endMs": 590162
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Okay, Sherman, you're a movie expert. So tell us, who's gay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 595024,
      "endMs": 599231
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Oh, I don't know. Harvey Fierstein.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 599438,
      "endMs": 601300
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "No. Who else?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 601507,
      "endMs": 604197
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "MacGyver's gay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606266,
      "endMs": 608266
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "You badmouthed MacGyver, didn't you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 614231,
      "endMs": 616679
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "What you doing, Marge?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 620783,
      "endMs": 622128
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Making the jury list for the film festival.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 622300,
      "endMs": 624369
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Mayor Quimby, Krusty, Jay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 624576,
      "endMs": 628197
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Marge, do you respect my intelligence?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 628403,
      "endMs": 631679
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Yes. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 633507,
      "endMs": 635472
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Wait a minute. Why did it take you so long to say yes?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 635645,
      "endMs": 639266
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "No reason. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 641679,
      "endMs": 644197
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Wait a minute. Are you humoring me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 644369,
      "endMs": 647472
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Yes. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 649955,
      "endMs": 651852
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Wait a minute. That's bad!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 652024,
      "endMs": 654128
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Look, I know I'm not witty like that critic guy...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654334,
      "endMs": 657128
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "...but does he know all the words to the Oscar Mayer song?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 657300,
      "endMs": 660817
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Oh, I wish I were an Oscar Mayer wiener That is what I'd truly like to be 'Cause if I were an Oscar Mayer wiener Everyone would be in love with me",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 660990,
      "endMs": 680197
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "That's it, Marge. He knows the whole hot-dog song.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 683955,
      "endMs": 686748
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Go ahead, sleep with him. I'll just take a lock of your hair to remember you by.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 686921,
      "endMs": 692714
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "It's just you and me now, lock of hair.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 692886,
      "endMs": 695266
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "You don't have to do this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695438,
      "endMs": 697162
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "You think I'm stupid. I don't think you're stupid.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 697403,
      "endMs": 700093
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Prove it. Put me on that film-jury-festival thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 700334,
      "endMs": 702852
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Fine. You're on the jury.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 703059,
      "endMs": 705990
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Sir, the actors are here to audition for the part of you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 711921,
      "endMs": 714610
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Excellent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714783,
      "endMs": 716197
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Excellent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 719059,
      "endMs": 720817
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Next. Excellent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 722059,
      "endMs": 723852
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Next. Exactly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 724059,
      "endMs": 727541
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Next.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 728576,
      "endMs": 729921
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Oh, it's hopeless. I'll have to play myself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 732093,
      "endMs": 735197
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "I thought they were playing The Rocky Horror Picture Show tonight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 738438,
      "endMs": 743403
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Our first film is by Indian director Apu Nahasapeemapetilon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 743645,
      "endMs": 747024
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Bright Lights, Beef Jerky.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 747197,
      "endMs": 750334
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Help! Help! Police!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 750541,
      "endMs": 752886
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Hey, I got problems of my own right now. Oh, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 753093,
      "endMs": 755438
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "This is gonna get worse before it gets better.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 755610,
      "endMs": 758093
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Next, we have Moe the bartender in Moe Better Booze.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760438,
      "endMs": 764403
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Money gets you one more round Drink it down, you stupid clown Money gets you one more round You're out on your ass My back!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 765576,
      "endMs": 776817
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Hans Moleman Productions presents...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 778645,
      "endMs": 781576
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "...Man Getting Hit by Football.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781748,
      "endMs": 785472
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "This contest is over. Give that man the $ 10,000!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 791817,
      "endMs": 796369
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "This isn't America 's Funniest Home Videos.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 796576,
      "endMs": 799334
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "But the ball, his groin. It works on so many levels.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 799541,
      "endMs": 806197
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Roll it again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 806817,
      "endMs": 808128
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Next, they're gonna show my movie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 808334,
      "endMs": 810197
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "You made a movie? I made a movie?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 810369,
      "endMs": 813266
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "No wonder I was on the cover of Entertainment Weekly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 813438,
      "endMs": 816541
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "My name is Barney Gumble. I'm 40, I'm single, and I drink.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 822921,
      "endMs": 829334
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "There's a line in Othello about a drinker.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 836783,
      "endMs": 839507
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Now a sensible man, by and by a fool, and presently a beast.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 839679,
      "endMs": 844197
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "That pretty well covers it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 844369,
      "endMs": 847059
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "It's brilliant. Savagely honest. Tender. He has the soul of a poet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 850803,
      "endMs": 855355
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "You're very kind.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 855528,
      "endMs": 856838
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Excuse me. Did something crawl down your throat and die?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 857010,
      "endMs": 859700
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "It didn't die.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 859838,
      "endMs": 861321
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "My name is Barney, and I'm an alcoholic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 861562,
      "endMs": 863941
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Mr. Gumble, this is a Girl Scout meeting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864148,
      "endMs": 866183
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Is it? Or is it that you girls can't admit you have a problem?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 866355,
      "endMs": 870976
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Don 't cry for me. I'm already dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 876666,
      "endMs": 881217
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "I think we have a winner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 892252,
      "endMs": 893769
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "What'd I miss? Homer, please pay attention.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 893941,
      "endMs": 896355
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "There's just one more movie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 896528,
      "endMs": 898355
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Simple villagers, I promise you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 910145,
      "endMs": 912058
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "...I will close plants in America and bring work here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 912259,
      "endMs": 915481
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "We did 20 takes, and that was the best one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 925380,
      "endMs": 928568
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Remember, Elliott, I'll be right here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 928769,
      "endMs": 931924
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Pure egotism. Self-indulgent tripe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 942135,
      "endMs": 944585
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "I don't care what they say. I'm going to win this festival.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944853,
      "endMs": 948242
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Drink up, Judah Ben-Hur.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 959350,
      "endMs": 961497
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "You truly are the king of kings.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 963309,
      "endMs": 967504
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Excellent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 968813,
      "endMs": 971195
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Smithers, are they booing me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 973233,
      "endMs": 974933
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "No. They're saying, \"Boo-urns, Boo-urns.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 975133,
      "endMs": 979700
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Are you saying, \"Boo,\" or, \"Boo-urns\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 979967,
      "endMs": 982533
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "I was saying, \"Boo-urns.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 984900,
      "endMs": 987967
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "All right, it's time to vote for the grand prize.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 989750,
      "endMs": 992550
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "I vote for Barney Gumble's sensitive yet unfortunately titled film, Pukahantas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 992750,
      "endMs": 998317
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Second! Well, I vote for Burns' movie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 998550,
      "endMs": 1000883
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Me too. Now let's get going. I got a date with Eudora Welty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1001083,
      "endMs": 1005583
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Coming, Eudora!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1006350,
      "endMs": 1008417
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Excellent. Bribing those two judges has paid off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1010783,
      "endMs": 1014417
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Like the Miss Teen America pageant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1014617,
      "endMs": 1016217
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "How can you vote for Burns' movie?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1018017,
      "endMs": 1019717
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Let's just say it moved me to a bigger house!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1019883,
      "endMs": 1024217
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "I said the quiet part loud and the loud part quiet. Oh, dear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1024350,
      "endMs": 1028050
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Two to two. Well, Homer, it all comes down to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1028283,
      "endMs": 1031217
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Football in the Groin! Football in the Groin!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1031417,
      "endMs": 1034050
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "We're not gonna resolve this deadlock anytime soon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1034283,
      "endMs": 1036150
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Why don't we all take a five-minute break. It'll clear our heads.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1036167,
      "endMs": 1039533
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Good idea, Marge. My mind is going a mile a minute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1039700,
      "endMs": 1044033
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "I knew this would happen. I put you on the jury...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1047767,
      "endMs": 1050133
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "...and you vote for the stupidest film. - I have a right to be on that jury...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050333,
      "endMs": 1054033
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "...even though I'm sleeping with the head of the festival.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1054233,
      "endMs": 1057133
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "How many times have I heard Rex Reed say that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1057333,
      "endMs": 1060133
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Great. Now you're gonna make fun of me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1060367,
      "endMs": 1062200
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "No, Homer. I won't make fun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062433,
      "endMs": 1063800
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "But I will suggest there may be better things in life...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1063967,
      "endMs": 1066667
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "...than seeing a man get hit in the groin with a football.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1066800,
      "endMs": 1072133
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Well, Homer?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1072333,
      "endMs": 1073633
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Marge, I've got some serious thinking to do.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1073800,
      "endMs": 1077767
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Barney's movie had heart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1079050,
      "endMs": 1080418
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "But Football in the Groin had a football in the groin.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1080618,
      "endMs": 1084022
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Don 't cry for me. I'm already dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1084189,
      "endMs": 1087860
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Wow, I'll never drink another beer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1088027,
      "endMs": 1090796
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Beer here. I'll take 10.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1090963,
      "endMs": 1092632
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "And now to announce the winners.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1093066,
      "endMs": 1094768
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "The award for outstanding animated short goes to...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1094968,
      "endMs": 1098238
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "...Itchy and Scratchy for their film Four Funerals and a Wedding.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1098405,
      "endMs": 1103511
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "And now the winner of the grand prize.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1129342,
      "endMs": 1131478
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Barney Gumble!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1134048,
      "endMs": 1135583
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1135783,
      "endMs": 1137418
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Homie, you voted for the right movie. I'm glad you were on the jury.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1140488,
      "endMs": 1145794
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "You know something, Marge? It's not that tough being a film cricket.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1147129,
      "endMs": 1151968
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "I've learned I have a gift to share with the world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1152369,
      "endMs": 1154771
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "From now on, there'll be a new Barnard Gumble. Hardworking, clean and sober.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1154938,
      "endMs": 1160411
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Congratulations, Barney. And enjoy your grand prize...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1160578,
      "endMs": 1163681
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "...a lifetime supply of Duff Beer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1163882,
      "endMs": 1167152
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Just hook it to my veins!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1167352,
      "endMs": 1170823
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Goodbye, Mr. Sherman. If I ever play Carnegie Hall, I'll give you a call.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1172358,
      "endMs": 1176396
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "And if you ever want to visit my show...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1176563,
      "endMs": 1178465
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "We're not gonna be doing that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1178698,
      "endMs": 1180167
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "I hope you tell your New York friends...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1180300,
      "endMs": 1182169
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "...that people in small towns aren't quite as dumb as they think.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1182369,
      "endMs": 1185473
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Marge, look. This has spring snakes inside...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185640,
      "endMs": 1188009
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "...but the suckers will think it's beer nuts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1188142,
      "endMs": 1191213
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Beer nuts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1191513,
      "endMs": 1193749
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "Well, it was a lovely festival. The best movie won...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1194450,
      "endMs": 1197620
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "...and Mr. Burns found there are some awards that can't be bought.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1197820,
      "endMs": 1201191
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "And the Oscar goes to...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1201357,
      "endMs": 1202559
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "I've got to win this one. I bribed everyone in Hollywood.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1204027,
      "endMs": 1207498
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "...George C. Scott in Man Getting Hit by Football.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1207731,
      "endMs": 1210902
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "My groin. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1217642,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 6,
    "episode": 18
  }
}
